exports[`first-run onboarding on the stead > chooses the bare host with its limitation and the one install step when the node serves no workshops > 3 workshop, bare host 1`] = `
"a creature for C:/src/stead
  name █
  skin █
> workshop
  models
[portrait kid]
Where its threads run.
  one install step: Docker Sandboxes (sbx), winget install -h Docker.sbx on Windows; the workshop pane raises a sealed one afterwards
> █ a bare host workshop on this machine
    this node serves no workshops yet (this host serves no workshops); threads run on the bare node
j k move · enter keeps · i opens a terminal for the install step · esc skips and takes what this machine has · a accepts the rest · backspace goes back · x not now"
`;

